# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# HireFlow Trivy Ignore List (.trivyignore)
# Documented scanner exclusions for unavoidable transitive vulnerabilities
# in Spring Boot 3.3.5 and Apache Tika 3.2.2 stacks.
# Handled under M2/M3 Final Handoff (Requirements R3, R4, R5).
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------

